      "correct": 1,
      "rationale": "The singular subject is “angle” (not the plural “nestmates” or “flowers”), so the singular verb “tells” is correct. “Tell” wrongly agrees with a nearer plural noun, while “telling” and “to tell” are non-finite and leave the clause without a main verb.",
      "paceSeconds": 40
