      "skill": "text-structure",
      "domain": "Craft and Structure",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "passage": "For a long time, gas street lamps had to be lit by hand each evening, one by one, by crews who walked fixed routes at dusk. **The arrival of electric lighting let an entire district switch on at the flip of a single distant switch.** What had been an hour of labor became an instant, and the lamplighter's trade quietly disappeared.",
